9. Impact and Significance
The proposed system can help identify potentially harmful online comments more efficiently and support safer online communication. It can reduce the effort required for initial comment screening and assist moderators in deciding which comments may need further attention. The project also demonstrates the practical application of AI, NLP, and machine learning in addressing cyberbullying and online toxicity. Since automated predictions may be incorrect or influenced by language context, human review remains important.

10. Deliverables
